note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note gpu/runtime/apiplan.om: rewrite of CUDApp src/omega_api_plan.h (ap_plan and ap_om). One family number picks
note one of the six plan units of gpu/nvidia/om/components (0 api_mm_plan, 1 api_at_plan, 2 api_ew_plan,
note 3 api_bf_plan, 4 api_da_plan, 5 api_rt_plan); a[0..7] are its inputs and a[8..15] its outputs. The result is
note what the C returns to its caller: 0, or minus the plan's refusal 1..3; -1 for a family the C does not know
note or a refusal above 3. Composed after those six units. The C plans of the header (ap_c) are the old
note implementation kept as the reference; gpu/runtime/check/apiplan-check.om compares the two.
fn ap_plan f ulong mode ulong a edit ulong 16 to long
rc = ulong 4
if eq f 0
rc = api_mm_plan mode a
end
if eq f 1
rc = api_at_plan mode a
end
if eq f 2
rc = api_ew_plan mode a
end
if eq f 3
rc = api_bf_plan mode a
end
if eq f 4
rc = api_da_plan mode a
end
if eq f 5
rc = api_rt_plan mode a
end
if le rc 3
ret neg long rc
end
ret long -1
end
